{"step_index":120,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-10-01T12:54:22Z","content":"Priyanshu, do seedhe sawaal hain, do seedhe jawab:\n\n## 1. Inverter vs UPS — Kya Problem Hogi?\n\n**Agar ghar pe inverter hai, toh UPS ki zaroorat nahi.** Mac mini sirf 10-15W khaata hai idle mein (phone charger jaisa). Inverter aaram se sambhal lega.\n\n| Situation | Kya hoga |\n|:---|:---|\n| **Bijli gayi, inverter ne switch kiya** | Mac mini chalu rahega. Modern inverters 5-20ms mein switch karte hain — Mac mini ko pata bhi nahi chalega |\n| **Inverter ka output** | Agar tera inverter **pure sine wave** hai (₹5,000+ wale) toh perfect. Square wave inverters mein sometimes electronics mein hum/noise aata hai, lekin Mac mini ke power adapter handle kar leta hai |\n| **Mac mini ka load** | Peak pe bhi 60W. Tera inverter 500W-1500W handle karta hoga. Mac mini ka load uske liye kuch bhi nahi hai |\n\n**Short answer: Inverter = kafi. UPS mat le alag se.**\n\n---\n\n## 2. Ghar Pe Internet Chahiye? Wi-Fi Lagwana Padega?\n\n**Haan. 100%. Bina internet ke remote access IMPOSSIBLE hai.**\n\nSamjha aise:\n\n```\nTu (Cafe mein, cafe ka Wi-Fi)\n    ↓ Internet\n    ↓ Tailscale VPN\n    ↓ Internet\nMac mini (Ghar pe, GHAR KA internet chahiye)\n```\n\n**Dono ends pe internet chahiye.*